      "writtenOn": "2022-06-15T02:38:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is a requirement from Android CDD 7.7.1.\n\nIf device implementations include a USB port and implement the AOA specification,\n[C-2-2] The USB mass storage class MUST include the string \"android\" at the end of the interface description iInterface string of the USB mass storage.\n\nThis is why I use this config.",
